<title>USA: Asia Pulp &amp; Paper at 12-5/8 in New York.</title>
<headline>Asia Pulp &amp; Paper at 12-5/8 in New York.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asian Pulp &amp; Paper closed at 12-5/8 in New York on Tuesday. It recorded the day's low of 12-3/8 and the day's high of 12-5/8.</p>
<p>Volume was 26,000 American Depository Shares. Block volume was nil. Its previous close on Monday was 12-1/2.</p>
<p>One ADS represents four common shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
</text>
